sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Cliente
    participant H as Handler HTTP
    participant S as Servicio
    participant D as Round2
    participant G as escalaSana

    C->>H: PUT price 1e100000000 (47 bytes)
    Note over H: decodifica el JSON<br/>valor=1, exp=100000000
    H->>S: SetProductPrice(price)
    S->>D: Round2(price)
    D->>G: exponente entre -20 y 20?
    G-->>D: no (es 100000000)
    Note over D: devuelve el valor SIN redondear<br/>cero calculo, cero memoria
    D-->>S: valor intacto
    S->>S: ValidMoney lo rechaza
    S-->>H: ErrValidation
    H-->>C: 400 en 0 s
